[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_crawl")
text = "NOT FAR FROM NOW

Drones do most of the world's flying. They race in packed stadiums, carry the city's cargo, check its towers, and find the lost when the weather turns.

Anyone can buy a drone. Almost no one can really fly one. The few who can are stars, and the teams pay them well.

So the teams hide their tryouts where the best pilots already are: inside a racing game, played at home.

You have been playing it for months. Every lap. Every clean gate. Someone has been watching.

Tonight, a scout is on the line.

Take the jobs. Win the races. Shed the assists one by one, until you fly raw, and then until you command a fleet.

Your crew talks you through every job. Some jobs put them in harm's way. Keep them safe. What happens out there is forever.

THIS IS DRONE SPORTS"
start_delay = 1.5
speed = 22.0
loop_pause = 6.0
